e row-independent procedure scipy.stats.ttest_ind under authorized_key_columns [spool_id] contradicts the declaration, since declaring spool_id as the independent unit with six rows per spool entails that rows are not independent observations for a row-level t-test."]},"ttft_ms":11236,"ttft_stream_ms":2622,"time_to_request_ms":15,"type":"result","duration_ms":27889,"uuid":"26387a8d-9093-431a-9d0c-de0bdd877a6e"}
